 :behavior
 {:create-resume "extensionPaths belongs to the owning open request. Omission and [] are distinct on the wire; either clears existing explicit entries on resume. No change to parent-extension joins (excluded)."
  :mcp "deferTools applies to local and remote server configs, including custom-agent servers. Omit rather than invent a default."
  :images "UserInputResponse inherits UIUserInputResponse's existing answer and wasFreeform and adds optional attachments. ElicitationParams still accepts only message/requestedSchema; negotiated metadata is separate from primitive form content."
  :form-images "Python test_elicitation_image_metadata_survives_event_handler_and_rpc corroborates a version 1 offer with fieldNames and no size limits. The legacy question callback instead requires imageAttachmentConstraints."
  :early-events "Compare CopilotClient.holdSessionEvent/deliverHeldSessionEvents/routeSession and CopilotSession._dispatchEvent: preserve pre-registration observations without executing already settled requests on the wrong generation."
  :auth "The authType union widens to include account, token-provider and copilot-api-token; the existing Clojure decoder accepts extensible identifiers."
  :permission-choices "The public PermissionRequestResult includes PermissionDecisionRequest.result. Its five listed variants accept an optional, non-null selectedOptionId; both automatic and manual replies forward the chosen option without adding attribution."
  :permission-mode-result "CopilotSession.permissionModeResult includes the optional reason string when the runtime reports a refused mode. session-info preserves the result without exposing the experimental setter."
  :events "The CLI wire union grows from 178 to 185 variants; Node's exported union grows from 157 to 159. Do not count wire-only prompt cache or tool-baseline events as new public operations. Optional occurredAt is distinct from the envelope timestamp."
  :runtime "Native engine fixes and Rust panic termination ship in the upstream classifier. Node FFI bindings and protocol 4 are unchanged; no CLI transport or Java SDK dependency."
  :mode-defaults "Node applyModeDefaults treats null or undefined like an unset member when applying mode defaults. The Clojure typed API represents unset by omission and rejects nil on non-nullable options; explicit false and empty values are not defaults."
  :lifecycle "CopilotClient.start replacement waiters and child-process shutdown changes do not introduce a reusable Clojure client. open-client!! returns an owned active handle; a closed handle is not restarted. Resident skill provider selection during overlapping resumes is not applicable: the Clojure client rejects replacement of a live handle."
  :excluded "Host-policy prechecks, progress reporting and extension-source overrides have experimental backing types. Settings projections and generated accounts, file logs, MCP secrets, plugin and other RPC declarations do not add stable high-level methods. The new extension manifest schema is a data asset."
  :tests "The mirrored source tree contains no nodejs/test directory at either tag. Preserve the 2.0.1 inventory; target tests compare pinned symbols, exercise Clojure builders, callbacks, events and the released native host."}}
